We fabricated14 a series of 3 × 3 square lattice arrays of few-dopant quantum dots that are weakly tunnel coupled to a source and drain and capacitively coupled to two in-plane gates. Figure 1 shows STM images of the hydrogen lithography patterns from one of the arrays (average lattice constant \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
